(6075161, 892226, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems soft and unclear. I can see visible compression artifacts around some of the edges of the petals. Your file size of only 62k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.<br/> <br/>Aside from my anal fixation with jpeg compression, this is pretty well done. I like the creamy background and the way the buds are peeking out from behind the open flower.</td>', 'This seems soft and unclear. I can see visible compression artifacts around some of the edges of the petals. Your file size of only 62k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. Aside from my anal fixation with jpeg compression, this is pretty well done. I like the creamy background and the way the buds are peeking out from behind the open flower.', '2010-07-01 01:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
