(6075317, 894541, 96751, '<td valign="top">Spectacular reflection.  I''m not crazy about the sky, though.  I''m not sure if it''s the color or how the clouds seem to have a bit of a shadow against it, but it looks like a backdrop.  Still, a stellar image.</td>', 'Spectacular reflection.  I''m not crazy about the sky, though.  I''m not sure if it''s the color or how the clouds seem to have a bit of a shadow against it, but it looks like a backdrop.  Still, a stellar image.', '2010-07-01 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
