(6075645, 894801, 104841, '<td valign="top">while I like the toning that you have applied here I cannot help but think that maybe the better photograph would have been a tighter crop around the three people, I don''t think that the empty table on the right is adding much, and it might be tricking your camera into overexposing this how shot as I think too much of the highlights have been blown out.</td>', 'while I like the toning that you have applied here I cannot help but think that maybe the better photograph would have been a tighter crop around the three people, I don''t think that the empty table on the right is adding much, and it might be tricking your camera into overexposing this how shot as I think too much of the highlights have been blown out.', '2010-07-01 10:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6075647, 891727, 104841, '<td valign="top">great location and I like the unusual angle you have going on, though maybe there is too much empty space and its hard to see he has a guitar, I was actually wondering what exactly he had around his neck until I saw the title.</td>', 'great location and I like the unusual angle you have going on, though maybe there is too much empty space and its hard to see he has a guitar, I was actually wondering what exactly he had around his neck until I saw the title.', '2010-07-01 10:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6075652, 894790, 104841, '<td valign="top">while it is nice to see that you are trying to follow the rule of thirds with the rock edges, i think the shot falls down because not that interesting and it is rather messy as you have frozen the action here. Perhaps pulling out the tripod and really slowing the shutter speed to maybe 1/2 or something to get a nice misty fell. Maybe a wider shot would have been good as well.</td>', 'while it is nice to see that you are trying to follow the rule of thirds with the rock edges, i think the shot falls down because not that interesting and it is rather messy as you have frozen the action here. Perhaps pulling out the tripod and really slowing the shutter speed to maybe 1/2 or something to get a nice misty fell. Maybe a wider shot would have been good as well.', '2010-07-01 10:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
