(6076558, 894585, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great scene. The choice of B&amp;W gives it a moon like feeling. I like the  bit of added vignetting to draw the eyes in.</td>', 'Great scene. The choice of B&W gives it a moon like feeling. I like the  bit of added vignetting to draw the eyes in.', '2010-07-02 00:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076559, 894609, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing the colors and life of the city. Seems a tiny bit oversharpened, which would work for print, but is a bit much for screen (in my opinion).</td>', 'Good job capturing the colors and life of the city. Seems a tiny bit oversharpened, which would work for print, but is a bit much for screen (in my opinion).', '2010-07-02 00:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076562, 892275, 114225, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. I think I would actually like the photo more if the person was more natural and not making a silly gesture. Great job using him as a reference for how large the rock ledge is.</td>', 'Love the idea. I think I would actually like the photo more if the person was more natural and not making a silly gesture. Great job using him as a reference for how large the rock ledge is.', '2010-07-02 00:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076563, 893803, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice overall capture. I do like the how you sharpened her eyes, and make the rest of her soft. It might be just a bit too soft, as it kind of looks plasticy to me.</td>', 'Nice overall capture. I do like the how you sharpened her eyes, and make the rest of her soft. It might be just a bit too soft, as it kind of looks plasticy to me.', '2010-07-02 00:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076565, 894834, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. Perfect timing with the sun just touching the hills. Good colors to the scene as well, although I wonder if you could have upped the saturation a bit to get even more powerful colors.</td>', 'I like this. Perfect timing with the sun just touching the hills. Good colors to the scene as well, although I wonder if you could have upped the saturation a bit to get even more powerful colors.', '2010-07-02 00:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076566, 894022, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, as an abstract, it''s neat. As an overall photo, I don''t find it super interesting. Nice job with the lighting thought.</td>', 'Hmm, as an abstract, it''s neat. As an overall photo, I don''t find it super interesting. Nice job with the lighting thought.', '2010-07-02 00:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076568, 894590, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea. My one qualm is with the lighting, especially on her bottom have. She really blends into the background (which with this theme, may have been on purpose), where I would have liked to see some details in the clothing.</td>', 'Great idea. My one qualm is with the lighting, especially on her bottom have. She really blends into the background (which with this theme, may have been on purpose), where I would have liked to see some details in the clothing.', '2010-07-02 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076572, 892356, 114225, '<td valign="top">I do really like the overall scene, especially how the further away hills fade away. I don''t like the overall blue cast which feels really un-natural.</td>', 'I do really like the overall scene, especially how the further away hills fade away. I don''t like the overall blue cast which feels really un-natural.', '2010-07-02 00:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076574, 894782, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait. Good use of vignetting to draw in the viewer''s eyes. I do which the eyes were more in focus.</td>', 'Very cute portrait. Good use of vignetting to draw in the viewer''s eyes. I do which the eyes were more in focus.', '2010-07-02 00:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076576, 893554, 114225, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see this being used as an album cover. Great job with the selective desaturation in this one.</td>', 'I can definitely see this being used as an album cover. Great job with the selective desaturation in this one.', '2010-07-02 00:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076582, 893316, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. I saw a scene almost just like this on my recent trip to Utah, but was on a plane so I couldn''t capture it. It''s great how you got some foreground elements to give the photo depth.<br/>My only qualm is that the moon doesn''t look natural. At this time of day, the moon should have a somewhat translucent feel, not fully opaque.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. I saw a scene almost just like this on my recent trip to Utah, but was on a plane so I couldn''t capture it. It''s great how you got some foreground elements to give the photo depth.My only qualm is that the moon doesn''t look natural. At this time of day, the moon should have a somewhat translucent feel, not fully opaque.', '2010-07-02 00:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076584, 894833, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the overall store here, but find it almost too distracting with the power lines and construction buildings. Maybe if you could have gotten higher up, so you could still see the top of the fence, and the background buildings, I would have like it somewhat more.</td>', 'I like the overall store here, but find it almost too distracting with the power lines and construction buildings. Maybe if you could have gotten higher up, so you could still see the top of the fence, and the background buildings, I would have like it somewhat more.', '2010-07-02 00:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076585, 894644, 114225, '<td valign="top">A good pet portrait with nice use of depth of field.</td>', 'A good pet portrait with nice use of depth of field.', '2010-07-02 00:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076588, 894719, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool photo (pun intended!). Great job getting some reflection in there, and pretty good clarity. I wonder if it could have been even better if the bird was closer to the right or left (entering or leaving the photo).</td>', 'Cool photo (pun intended!). Great job getting some reflection in there, and pretty good clarity. I wonder if it could have been even better if the bird was closer to the right or left (entering or leaving the photo).', '2010-07-02 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076590, 894832, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yum! Great clarity and lighting. I would definitely see this being used as stock photography.</td>', 'Yum! Great clarity and lighting. I would definitely see this being used as stock photography.', '2010-07-02 00:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076591, 894674, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. It''s too bad the jet wasn''t sharper, as it could have been really great.</td>', 'Cool photo. It''s too bad the jet wasn''t sharper, as it could have been really great.', '2010-07-02 00:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
