(6076608, 891727, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job telling a story with this photo. I believe the til actually adds a bit to that story.</td>', 'Great job telling a story with this photo. I believe the til actually adds a bit to that story.', '2010-07-02 00:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
