(6076614, 893974, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at a difficult capture. I would have liked to see more sharpness in the eye (focus point feel like it''s at the butt), and I''m wondering what the bight spot is.</td>', 'Good attempt at a difficult capture. I would have liked to see more sharpness in the eye (focus point feel like it''s at the butt), and I''m wondering what the bight spot is.', '2010-07-02 00:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076617, 894588, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing the action. Too bad he wasn''t facing you (I''m guessing that''s where the title comes from). But great job with sharpness.</td>', 'Nice job capturing the action. Too bad he wasn''t facing you (I''m guessing that''s where the title comes from). But great job with sharpness.', '2010-07-02 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076619, 890160, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, it makes goos use of the natural S-line. I like the choice of B&amp;W here.</td>', 'Good perspective, it makes goos use of the natural S-line. I like the choice of B&W here.', '2010-07-02 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076622, 894697, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good scene. Looks very peaceful. I like the filtered light.</td>', 'Good scene. Looks very peaceful. I like the filtered light.', '2010-07-02 00:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076625, 894643, 114225, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see this as anything other that a simple snapshot of the concert. I''m sure this helps you remember the great time you had, but the interest to others is low.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see this as anything other that a simple snapshot of the concert. I''m sure this helps you remember the great time you had, but the interest to others is low.', '2010-07-02 00:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076626, 894347, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think this photo could have benefitted from a different perspective, maybe one that could make nice use of depth of field. As it stand, I don''t care for it cutting off the entire back of the car (maybe just turning it from landscape to portrait would have helped).</td>', 'I think this photo could have benefitted from a different perspective, maybe one that could make nice use of depth of field. As it stand, I don''t care for it cutting off the entire back of the car (maybe just turning it from landscape to portrait would have helped).', '2010-07-02 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076627, 894235, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good capture, and relatively good sharpness (I''m sure it wasn''t hard to get focus with how fast it was moving.</td>', 'Good capture, and relatively good sharpness (I''m sure it wasn''t hard to get focus with how fast it was moving.', '2010-07-02 00:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076628, 890709, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ok, I think I wee where you were going here. The high key with extreme contrast gives the feeling that the dog is walking on glass. But maybe it would have worked better if just that was done, without the distracting elements of the background (especially the people).</td>', 'Ok, I think I wee where you were going here. The high key with extreme contrast gives the feeling that the dog is walking on glass. But maybe it would have worked better if just that was done, without the distracting elements of the background (especially the people).', '2010-07-02 00:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076629, 893529, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the texture of the eyes. My suggestion would be to either use indirect or difussed light, as the blown highlights are super distracting.</td>', 'Great job capturing the texture of the eyes. My suggestion would be to either use indirect or difussed light, as the blown highlights are super distracting.', '2010-07-02 00:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076631, 892289, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really great perspective, not something most people see. I like the choice of B&amp;W here, as it brings out a ton of details.</td>', 'Really great perspective, not something most people see. I like the choice of B&W here, as it brings out a ton of details.', '2010-07-02 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076632, 894564, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and softness to this photo.</td>', 'Great lighting and softness to this photo.', '2010-07-02 00:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076634, 893562, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good attempt. What this photo really needs is tack sharpness, which it simply doesn''t have. Also, maybe turning down the color saturation down a bit would help, as it feels neon bright.</td>', 'Good attempt. What this photo really needs is tack sharpness, which it simply doesn''t have. Also, maybe turning down the color saturation down a bit would help, as it feels neon bright.', '2010-07-02 00:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
