(6076636, 892856, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of bokeh. Also, the orange against the green really draws in the attention of the viewr.</td>', 'Good use of bokeh. Also, the orange against the green really draws in the attention of the viewr.', '2010-07-02 00:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076640, 894587, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting the entire scene in focus, from the foreground trees to the mountains. However, while I often like natural borders, in this case I think the photo could have been better without the foreground trees, as the mountains are so spectacular, I don''t want to have any part of them covered up.</td>', 'Nice job getting the entire scene in focus, from the foreground trees to the mountains. However, while I often like natural borders, in this case I think the photo could have been better without the foreground trees, as the mountains are so spectacular, I don''t want to have any part of them covered up.', '2010-07-02 00:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076641, 894627, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great color here, and an almost erie softness to the water.</td>', 'Great color here, and an almost erie softness to the water.', '2010-07-02 00:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076643, 893518, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great title for this photo. Good job capturing details in the fur, and use of bokeh.</td>', 'Great title for this photo. Good job capturing details in the fur, and use of bokeh.', '2010-07-02 00:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076644, 894491, 114225, '<td valign="top">I do like what you were trying for here, but my view on this is way way too soft. It looks unnatural, and even plastic like.</td>', 'I do like what you were trying for here, but my view on this is way way too soft. It looks unnatural, and even plastic like.', '2010-07-02 00:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076645, 892923, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good capture of a cool scene. My only nitpick is the red seems a bit over-saturated, giving all the red parts of the balloons an almost neon feel.</td>', 'Good capture of a cool scene. My only nitpick is the red seems a bit over-saturated, giving all the red parts of the balloons an almost neon feel.', '2010-07-02 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
