(6076651, 894172, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. The water flowing through rocks in the ocean can be hard to capture, so I''m glad you did it well. I think I would have chosen to not see so much sky, but that''s just me.</td>', 'I like this. The water flowing through rocks in the ocean can be hard to capture, so I''m glad you did it well. I think I would have chosen to not see so much sky, but that''s just me.', '2010-07-02 00:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076652, 894618, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, great photo! Looking close, there is not only a good silhouette, but also some nice colors from the setting sun in near the horizon.</td>', 'Wow, great photo! Looking close, there is not only a good silhouette, but also some nice colors from the setting sun in near the horizon.', '2010-07-02 00:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076653, 894551, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a very good scene. I am sure the bike is meaningful for you, but I think I would have like it better without the bike.</td>', 'Overall, a very good scene. I am sure the bike is meaningful for you, but I think I would have like it better without the bike.', '2010-07-02 00:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
