(6076909, 894781, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is some tiny depth of field. Good lighting and nice details.</td>', 'Wow, that is some tiny depth of field. Good lighting and nice details.', '2010-07-02 09:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076911, 891520, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great panoramic like view. With this crop, it gives the viewer a great sense for how enormous the area is.</td>', 'Great panoramic like view. With this crop, it gives the viewer a great sense for how enormous the area is.', '2010-07-02 09:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076912, 892612, 114225, '<td valign="top">At first, I was a bit bored with the image. But as I look more, and saw the multi-layered sky, it definitely become more interesting.</td>', 'At first, I was a bit bored with the image. But as I look more, and saw the multi-layered sky, it definitely become more interesting.', '2010-07-02 09:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076913, 892200, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good balance to this photo. The body is showing good detail. They head/eye looks a little bit soft to me.</td>', 'Good balance to this photo. The body is showing good detail. They head/eye looks a little bit soft to me.', '2010-07-02 09:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076914, 894598, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors. It''s wonderful how you have the light filtering down through the forest.</td>', 'Great composition and colors. It''s wonderful how you have the light filtering down through the forest.', '2010-07-02 09:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076915, 893464, 60614, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot.  I think if you put the in the cross hairs of the rule of thirds then the focus would be more on hte ticket.  Also if that stick wasn''t there would help I think.  My eyes kept moving back to the stick.  Great idea.  Tones were complimentary.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot.  I think if you put the in the cross hairs of the rule of thirds then the focus would be more on hte ticket.  Also if that stick wasn''t there would help I think.  My eyes kept moving back to the stick.  Great idea.  Tones were complimentary.', '2010-07-02 09:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076917, 894755, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy these type''s of photos. Were you night diving around these guys?</td>', 'I really enjoy these type''s of photos. Were you night diving around these guys?', '2010-07-02 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076918, 894119, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, and good job making it more interesting with a pattern. I really like how there is a reflection of the drops in the main body of water.</td>', 'Nice clarity, and good job making it more interesting with a pattern. I really like how there is a reflection of the drops in the main body of water.', '2010-07-02 09:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076920, 892180, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this photo overall. It''s funny how the duck doesn''t seem to want to get wet :)<br/>HOwever, the focus feels just a bit soft to me. IF it were sharper, this would have been a great photo.</td>', 'I like this photo overall. It''s funny how the duck doesn''t seem to want to get wet :)HOwever, the focus feels just a bit soft to me. IF it were sharper, this would have been a great photo.', '2010-07-02 09:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076923, 893366, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. Having parts of the plane cut off really does give a feeling of it being close.</td>', 'Cool photo. Having parts of the plane cut off really does give a feeling of it being close.', '2010-07-02 09:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076924, 894318, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a decent night shot. I;m wondering why there seems to be a shadow of a tree in the left half. Iw that always there?</td>', 'Overall, a decent night shot. I;m wondering why there seems to be a shadow of a tree in the left half. Iw that always there?', '2010-07-02 09:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076926, 894392, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good capture of our current events. You can definitely see the black in the waves, and some staining of the sand. I like that you have the pier in the shot, as it adds a bit of interest.</td>', 'Good capture of our current events. You can definitely see the black in the waves, and some staining of the sand. I like that you have the pier in the shot, as it adds a bit of interest.', '2010-07-02 09:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
