(6076929, 894191, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy. I like the lighting, as it gradually gets darker to the left. I wonder if a bit more interest could have been added to the photo with some tea/coffee in the cup and maybe a spoon resting on the saucer.</td>', 'Looks yummy. I like the lighting, as it gradually gets darker to the left. I wonder if a bit more interest could have been added to the photo with some tea/coffee in the cup and maybe a spoon resting on the saucer.', '2010-07-02 09:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
