(6076933, 893827, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, texture, and colors to this photo.</td>', 'Great clarity, texture, and colors to this photo.', '2010-07-02 10:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076934, 894695, 114225, '<td valign="top">A cool scene which I imagine was very imposing. Unfortunately, the photo feels a bit flat to me (not sure how to best describe it).</td>', 'A cool scene which I imagine was very imposing. Unfortunately, the photo feels a bit flat to me (not sure how to best describe it).', '2010-07-02 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076936, 893784, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details, especially with seeing the pollen covering their little bodies.</td>', 'Great details, especially with seeing the pollen covering their little bodies.', '2010-07-02 10:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076937, 894612, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of tennis, so I don''t know if a more interesting angle could have been used. But I do think a shallower depth of field could have been useful to blur some of the distracting background.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of tennis, so I don''t know if a more interesting angle could have been used. But I do think a shallower depth of field could have been useful to blur some of the distracting background.', '2010-07-02 10:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076939, 894824, 60614, '<td valign="top">Yeah my kayaking has been waiting also.  It hangs in my garage.  I really need to get it out sometime.  If we didn''t have so many alligators in her Florida I would probably have an easier time getting some one to go with me.  Love the choice of B/W.  Nice and crisp focus.  You have wonderful leading lines and angles.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Yeah my kayaking has been waiting also.  It hangs in my garage.  I really need to get it out sometime.  If we didn''t have so many alligators in her Florida I would probably have an easier time getting some one to go with me.  Love the choice of B/W.  Nice and crisp focus.  You have wonderful leading lines and angles.  Nicely done.', '2010-07-02 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076940, 894516, 60614, '<td valign="top">Classic, Funny and Sad all rolled in one.  Awesome shot.  Wonderful complimentary colors.  The POV tells a very drastic story from the big fat slimy frog''s perspective.  Now from the Tri-colored Heron''s perspective it is a happy happy ending with a nice full stomach.  What makes this photo is the fact it is not just a bird photo and it is not just a frog photo.  It is a photo showing the natural order of things in nature.  Well done.</td>', 'Classic, Funny and Sad all rolled in one.  Awesome shot.  Wonderful complimentary colors.  The POV tells a very drastic story from the big fat slimy frog''s perspective.  Now from the Tri-colored Heron''s perspective it is a happy happy ending with a nice full stomach.  What makes this photo is the fact it is not just a bird photo and it is not just a frog photo.  It is a photo showing the natural order of things in nature.  Well done.', '2010-07-02 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076952, 894801, 60614, '<td valign="top">The tones caught my eye which caused me to stop and look.  I don''t know what it is but I like it.  Must be the story telling feel that you have achieved.  Each person seems to be in the own world.  Don''t know if this was planned or not but the leading line you have achieved starting from the lady in the fore front to the lady in the back is fantastic.  Well done.</td>', 'The tones caught my eye which caused me to stop and look.  I don''t know what it is but I like it.  Must be the story telling feel that you have achieved.  Each person seems to be in the own world.  Don''t know if this was planned or not but the leading line you have achieved starting from the lady in the fore front to the lady in the back is fantastic.  Well done.', '2010-07-02 10:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076955, 894110, 114225, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential for being a great shot. Two things need to be improved, in my eyes: the focus should be tack sharp, hopefully across the entire body. The lighting is causing some really blown out reflections that are distracting.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential for being a great shot. Two things need to be improved, in my eyes: the focus should be tack sharp, hopefully across the entire body. The lighting is causing some really blown out reflections that are distracting.', '2010-07-02 10:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076956, 894138, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great colors, especially the greens in such a warm scene. I love how the tree is used as a sign post :)</td>', 'Great colors, especially the greens in such a warm scene. I love how the tree is used as a sign post :)', '2010-07-02 10:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076958, 894613, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great choice of tones.  Fits the photo perfectly.  Love the one blue eye and the tilt of the hat.  Composition is spot on in my humble opinion.  What a cutie.</td>', 'Great choice of tones.  Fits the photo perfectly.  Love the one blue eye and the tilt of the hat.  Composition is spot on in my humble opinion.  What a cutie.', '2010-07-02 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076959, 894079, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful selective focus and title for this image. It would have probably been even better without the people in the background.</td>', 'Wonderful selective focus and title for this image. It would have probably been even better without the people in the background.', '2010-07-02 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076960, 894764, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, that''s a frog. At first, I thought the red dot was an eye :)<br/>I really like that you decided to enter this photo. Every photographer has had the subject move, but normally we don''t get to document it with good composition :)</td>', 'Ohhh, that''s a frog. At first, I thought the red dot was an eye :)I really like that you decided to enter this photo. Every photographer has had the subject move, but normally we don''t get to document it with good composition :)', '2010-07-02 10:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076962, 893713, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I like how the moon is visible in this shot. Without the skyline and moon, I think this would have been an average shot, but those elements make it a bit above average.</td>', 'Ooh, I like how the moon is visible in this shot. Without the skyline and moon, I think this would have been an average shot, but those elements make it a bit above average.', '2010-07-02 10:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076964, 893846, 60614, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Osprey photo.  See these all along the river here in Florida.  Never can get a photo like this from my perspective.  Composition fits this scene perfectly.</td>', 'Wonderful Osprey photo.  See these all along the river here in Florida.  Never can get a photo like this from my perspective.  Composition fits this scene perfectly.', '2010-07-02 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076966, 894765, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the details and grander of this area. The eyes just keep moving around, as they can''t get enough of the scene.</td>', 'Great job capturing the details and grander of this area. The eyes just keep moving around, as they can''t get enough of the scene.', '2010-07-02 10:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076968, 894714, 89170, '<td valign="top">Great job with a beautiful model.  I found the lamp a bit distracting as well as the bright spot just behind her.  Perhaps a shallower DOF.</td>', 'Great job with a beautiful model.  I found the lamp a bit distracting as well as the bright spot just behind her.  Perhaps a shallower DOF.', '2010-07-02 10:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076969, 894548, 114225, '<td valign="top">The lighting and focus is good for this shot. To me, it doesn''t hold a ton of interest.</td>', 'The lighting and focus is good for this shot. To me, it doesn''t hold a ton of interest.', '2010-07-02 10:19:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6076971, 894611, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but to me, it looks like the focus is just a tiny bit off (either that, or it could use some extra sharpening to bring out more details).</td>', 'Nice capture, but to me, it looks like the focus is just a tiny bit off (either that, or it could use some extra sharpening to bring out more details).', '2010-07-02 10:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076972, 894159, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a very pleasing abstract. A lot of nice colors, and an main object that is clearly visible.</td>', 'This is a very pleasing abstract. A lot of nice colors, and an main object that is clearly visible.', '2010-07-02 10:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076973, 894607, 114225, '<td valign="top">A good portrait. I would have liked to see more light on the left side of her face, maybe using some reflectors so it''s nice and soft (it feels like maybe you did you a reflector to add the light that is there).</td>', 'A good portrait. I would have liked to see more light on the left side of her face, maybe using some reflectors so it''s nice and soft (it feels like maybe you did you a reflector to add the light that is there).', '2010-07-02 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076974, 894549, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with a creepy effect. Could be used for a horror movie poster.</td>', 'Nicely done with a creepy effect. Could be used for a horror movie poster.', '2010-07-02 10:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076975, 894043, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great textures and details in the skin. Good choice of B&amp;W for a photo like this, as it helps to accentuate the skin wrinkles.</td>', 'Great textures and details in the skin. Good choice of B&W for a photo like this, as it helps to accentuate the skin wrinkles.', '2010-07-02 10:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076976, 892927, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at the power of those jaws. I kind of wish the face shadows weren''t so harsh, but overall I like it.</td>', 'Wow, look at the power of those jaws. I kind of wish the face shadows weren''t so harsh, but overall I like it.', '2010-07-02 10:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076978, 894632, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool indeed. Going out on a day when the sky was cloudless was a good choice for this photo. Adds to the sense of serenity.</td>', 'Cool indeed. Going out on a day when the sky was cloudless was a good choice for this photo. Adds to the sense of serenity.', '2010-07-02 10:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076980, 894845, 114225, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it amazing how they can balance on weeds? This has a good use of bokeh, but I feel like the bird could be a bit sharper, especially around the head.</td>', 'Isn''t it amazing how they can balance on weeds? This has a good use of bokeh, but I feel like the bird could be a bit sharper, especially around the head.', '2010-07-02 10:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076982, 894803, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective used in this photo. I do with you used either a slightly faster shutter to eliminate the motion blur, or a longer shutter to add better sense of movement.</td>', 'I like the perspective used in this photo. I do with you used either a slightly faster shutter to eliminate the motion blur, or a longer shutter to add better sense of movement.', '2010-07-02 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076983, 894672, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good shot, with the silky smooth waves. I slightly wish there was more color to the sky, maybe even just by bumping up the saturation slightly.</td>', 'Good shot, with the silky smooth waves. I slightly wish there was more color to the sky, maybe even just by bumping up the saturation slightly.', '2010-07-02 10:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076985, 893800, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I guess I''m not the target audience for this type of shot, as it doesn''t hold much interest for me. I will say that I do like the lighting and visible skin texture.</td>', 'Hmm, I guess I''m not the target audience for this type of shot, as it doesn''t hold much interest for me. I will say that I do like the lighting and visible skin texture.', '2010-07-02 10:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076987, 894699, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the sky. I wish the scene didn''t have so much noise, as that''s distracting the eyes away from the beauty.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the sky. I wish the scene didn''t have so much noise, as that''s distracting the eyes away from the beauty.', '2010-07-02 10:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076988, 894516, 114225, '<td valign="top">I love the title ( I liked the shot before the title as well). Great colors and timing.</td>', 'I love the title ( I liked the shot before the title as well). Great colors and timing.', '2010-07-02 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076990, 890921, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the crop is so tight on this one. Makes the viewer feel like they are really interacting with the bird.</td>', 'I like how the crop is so tight on this one. Makes the viewer feel like they are really interacting with the bird.', '2010-07-02 10:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6076992, 894179, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good portrait of the man at work. The depth of field is perfect, blurring the equipment just enough to not be distracting, but you can still tell what it is.</td>', 'Good portrait of the man at work. The depth of field is perfect, blurring the equipment just enough to not be distracting, but you can still tell what it is.', '2010-07-02 10:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077015, 892180, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the angles created by the duck, but the image seems too soft of focus</td>', 'i like the angles created by the duck, but the image seems too soft of focus', '2010-07-02 10:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077016, 894770, 67152, '<td valign="top">interesting product shot - lovely light on the model but just wonder if a new can of the stuff would have made this come off a bit better</td>', 'interesting product shot - lovely light on the model but just wonder if a new can of the stuff would have made this come off a bit better', '2010-07-02 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077017, 892968, 67152, '<td valign="top">very cool windmills - i wish there was a bit more details in them to really allow us to see the interesting architecture there</td>', 'very cool windmills - i wish there was a bit more details in them to really allow us to see the interesting architecture there', '2010-07-02 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077019, 894632, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely natural blues with crisp sky - but it seems to lack something, maybe some leading lines or an object in the scene to pull us into the scene.  It may have also been interesting to get closer to the fence and use that as foreground to really create a more three dimensional image rather than the flat scene that is here now</td>', 'lovely natural blues with crisp sky - but it seems to lack something, maybe some leading lines or an object in the scene to pull us into the scene.  It may have also been interesting to get closer to the fence and use that as foreground to really create a more three dimensional image rather than the flat scene that is here now', '2010-07-02 10:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077022, 894110, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool closeup shot of this very pretty spider - i just wish it were a bit sharper and the light on the ''face'' was a bit better</td>', 'cool closeup shot of this very pretty spider - i just wish it were a bit sharper and the light on the ''face'' was a bit better', '2010-07-02 10:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077024, 894824, 67152, '<td valign="top">fantastic lines and composition - the b/w conversion is elegant - the light is rich and gorgeous -  this is stunning stuff</td>', 'fantastic lines and composition - the b/w conversion is elegant - the light is rich and gorgeous -  this is stunning stuff', '2010-07-02 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077027, 894543, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love how the people walking the inlet give us a sense of the scale of this visita.  i just wonder about the choice of composition a bit - as if a bit less sky at the top may have made the storm clouds more dramatic</td>', 'i love how the people walking the inlet give us a sense of the scale of this visita.  i just wonder about the choice of composition a bit - as if a bit less sky at the top may have made the storm clouds more dramatic', '2010-07-02 10:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077030, 894051, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool shot - love the background and how it almost looks like feathers themselves</td>', 'cool shot - love the background and how it almost looks like feathers themselves', '2010-07-02 10:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077032, 892976, 67152, '<td valign="top">great title for this image - the shape of the flower combined with its colors and the dark spot in the center really work together nicely</td>', 'great title for this image - the shape of the flower combined with its colors and the dark spot in the center really work together nicely', '2010-07-02 11:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077033, 893846, 67152, '<td valign="top">great wildlife shot - love the little guy sticking his tongue out at us</td>', 'great wildlife shot - love the little guy sticking his tongue out at us', '2010-07-02 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077035, 893139, 67152, '<td valign="top">beautiful location and nicely composed - the sundial really balances out the pier behind it</td>', 'beautiful location and nicely composed - the sundial really balances out the pier behind it', '2010-07-02 11:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077038, 894833, 67152, '<td valign="top">the barriers cannot win against that sunset</td>', 'the barriers cannot win against that sunset', '2010-07-02 11:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077039, 892845, 67152, '<td valign="top">mystical in the light and sweep of the water and sky</td>', 'mystical in the light and sweep of the water and sky', '2010-07-02 11:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077040, 894684, 67152, '<td valign="top">this makes me smile - love the shirt and the hat - i just wish his eyes were a wee bit better in focus</td>', 'this makes me smile - love the shirt and the hat - i just wish his eyes were a wee bit better in focus', '2010-07-02 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077043, 894590, 67152, '<td valign="top">ethereal in composition, pose, facial expression and processing</td>', 'ethereal in composition, pose, facial expression and processing', '2010-07-02 11:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077045, 893990, 67152, '<td valign="top">heartbreaking</td>', 'heartbreaking', '2010-07-02 11:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077047, 894567, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a sky - love the composition and almost everything about this shot</td>', 'what a sky - love the composition and almost everything about this shot', '2010-07-02 11:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077048, 894800, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool abstract macro - love how the light pulls our eyes around and around</td>', 'cool abstract macro - love how the light pulls our eyes around and around', '2010-07-02 11:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077051, 892301, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice capture - well done to get the details in teh feathers - i just am not sure about the purple spot on his neck as if it could be an artifact from some burning in processing</td>', 'nice capture - well done to get the details in teh feathers - i just am not sure about the purple spot on his neck as if it could be an artifact from some burning in processing', '2010-07-02 11:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077052, 889390, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a face - high key is the way to go on this one - she is just going to hate this when you show it to her sweetheart in high school?!</td>', 'what a face - high key is the way to go on this one - she is just going to hate this when you show it to her sweetheart in high school?!', '2010-07-02 11:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077053, 894550, 67152, '<td valign="top">magical yes - lovely light</td>', 'magical yes - lovely light', '2010-07-02 11:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077055, 893532, 67152, '<td valign="top">that is one intense stare as if it is ready to pounce - a bit oversaturation IMO but not too bad</td>', 'that is one intense stare as if it is ready to pounce - a bit oversaturation IMO but not too bad', '2010-07-02 11:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077056, 894675, 114225, '<td valign="top">The motion blur is done well and gives a great sense of motion. I think this photo would have really popped if the body of the rider was really sharp (obviously not easy to do).</td>', 'The motion blur is done well and gives a great sense of motion. I think this photo would have really popped if the body of the rider was really sharp (obviously not easy to do).', '2010-07-02 11:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077057, 893775, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely model - i just wish the light were not so flat and the processing so uninspired.</td>', 'lovely model - i just wish the light were not so flat and the processing so uninspired.', '2010-07-02 11:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077058, 893230, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love how the sunlight is just licking the front columns - i just am not crazy about the harsh halo around the roofline</td>', 'i love how the sunlight is just licking the front columns - i just am not crazy about the harsh halo around the roofline', '2010-07-02 11:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077059, 894818, 114225, '<td valign="top">For me, this shot doesn''t hold a lot of interest, although I''m sure it will for others. Technically, it''s a good amount of bokeh (not so much that you cannot determine what the background object is), but the blown out highlights are a bit too much.</td>', 'For me, this shot doesn''t hold a lot of interest, although I''m sure it will for others. Technically, it''s a good amount of bokeh (not so much that you cannot determine what the background object is), but the blown out highlights are a bit too much.', '2010-07-02 11:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077060, 891926, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job, I like when I learn something form the title :) <br/>Good use of water droplets to add a bit of extra interest.</td>', 'Nice job, I like when I learn something form the title :) Good use of water droplets to add a bit of extra interest.', '2010-07-02 11:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077061, 890709, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool use of high contrast to emphasize the people and blow out the water.  I''ll be honest with you, I am not a fan of the frame - cutting the guy off on the left side really distracts me a lot.</td>', 'cool use of high contrast to emphasize the people and blow out the water.  I''ll be honest with you, I am not a fan of the frame - cutting the guy off on the left side really distracts me a lot.', '2010-07-02 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077062, 894792, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image. Angling the boat gives a real sense of depth. I''m torn by the post processing. On one hand, I like the somewhat artistic feel. On the other hand, I get a feeling of overdone processing.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image. Angling the boat gives a real sense of depth. I''m torn by the post processing. On one hand, I like the somewhat artistic feel. On the other hand, I get a feeling of overdone processing.', '2010-07-02 11:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077063, 894754, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the intertwined lines of the shadows with the whole scene - but it is hard to find some story here to really draw me in</td>', 'i like the intertwined lines of the shadows with the whole scene - but it is hard to find some story here to really draw me in', '2010-07-02 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077064, 894347, 67152, '<td valign="top">these are really cool cars - i like the choice of border to emphasize the team name</td>', 'these are really cool cars - i like the choice of border to emphasize the team name', '2010-07-02 11:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077066, 894209, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this photo does hold some interest for me, but it feels like it could have held more. I like how the poles are leading the eye to the main subject, but it if were done more so the poles were leading away, I think it would have been more powerful. (PM me if this doesn''t make sense, I don''t think I explained it the best).</td>', 'Hmm, this photo does hold some interest for me, but it feels like it could have held more. I like how the poles are leading the eye to the main subject, but it if were done more so the poles were leading away, I think it would have been more powerful. (PM me if this doesn''t make sense, I don''t think I explained it the best).', '2010-07-02 11:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077069, 894700, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good opposites for the colors. IT really makes the pink pop. I feel this could have been slightly better with  less noise in the photo.</td>', 'Good opposites for the colors. IT really makes the pink pop. I feel this could have been slightly better with  less noise in the photo.', '2010-07-02 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077070, 892226, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective used here. It feels like the red saturation is a bit high, giving it a neon feel.</td>', 'I like the perspective used here. It feels like the red saturation is a bit high, giving it a neon feel.', '2010-07-02 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077072, 894536, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a good use of fish eye, it gives the viewer a good feeling for the expansiveness of the location. Good choice with the stadium at the center, that seems to provide a good anchor to the photo.</td>', 'This is a good use of fish eye, it gives the viewer a good feeling for the expansiveness of the location. Good choice with the stadium at the center, that seems to provide a good anchor to the photo.', '2010-07-02 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077073, 890555, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this has the feeling of a snapshot more than anything. I''m sure it helps you remember the excitement of the moment, but the lack of focus and what looks like on camera flash use don''t help to bring the viewer in.</td>', 'To me, this has the feeling of a snapshot more than anything. I''m sure it helps you remember the excitement of the moment, but the lack of focus and what looks like on camera flash use don''t help to bring the viewer in.', '2010-07-02 11:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077074, 894541, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene! Absolutely brilliant balance  to the photo, not just left/right but also up/down.</td>', 'Beautiful scene! Absolutely brilliant balance  to the photo, not just left/right but also up/down.', '2010-07-02 11:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077077, 891685, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like how you found an S-curve to use in the composition. I don''t like the relative softness of the photo. Maybe it could have been fixed with some extra sharpening.</td>', 'I really like how you found an S-curve to use in the composition. I don''t like the relative softness of the photo. Maybe it could have been fixed with some extra sharpening.', '2010-07-02 11:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077078, 894798, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the full frame face effect of these big cats. Not sure how I feel about the vignetting, in this case, it doesn''t really seem to dram me in (more acts like a distraction).</td>', 'I like the full frame face effect of these big cats. Not sure how I feel about the vignetting, in this case, it doesn''t really seem to dram me in (more acts like a distraction).', '2010-07-02 11:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077079, 894819, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the tiny dotted stars. :) 8</td>', 'I love the tiny dotted stars. :) 8', '2010-07-02 11:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077080, 894618, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely symmetry.  What a beautiful scene.</td>', 'Lovely symmetry.  What a beautiful scene.', '2010-07-02 11:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077082, 894801, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of random candidness. :) The invisible line connecting the people is cool.</td>', 'I like the sense of random candidness. :) The invisible line connecting the people is cool.', '2010-07-02 11:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077083, 894592, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on this shot, it helps with the intimacy of the moment. B&amp;W was a good choice for this.</td>', 'Great perspective on this shot, it helps with the intimacy of the moment. B&W was a good choice for this.', '2010-07-02 11:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
