(6077319, 890555, 17507, '<td valign="top">This photo looks like a snapshot. To make a photo compelling, it needs to look like more than three seconds were spent composing it.</td>', 'This photo looks like a snapshot. To make a photo compelling, it needs to look like more than three seconds were spent composing it.', '2010-07-02 13:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077322, 893139, 17507, '<td valign="top">Having your main subject more off center would add a lot of interest for me.</td>', 'Having your main subject more off center would add a lot of interest for me.', '2010-07-02 13:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077323, 894820, 17507, '<td valign="top">Interesting study in whites and a unique perspective on an oft-photographed city. I would have cloned out the people, or at least the one in red/pink on the right.</td>', 'Interesting study in whites and a unique perspective on an oft-photographed city. I would have cloned out the people, or at least the one in red/pink on the right.', '2010-07-02 13:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077327, 894770, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cute fingernails ~_~</td>', 'Cute fingernails ~_~', '2010-07-02 13:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077328, 894459, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the filtered light in this shot, gives a bit of mystery to the scene. I do wish the bridge was slightly brighter to show more details.</td>', 'I like the filtered light in this shot, gives a bit of mystery to the scene. I do wish the bridge was slightly brighter to show more details.', '2010-07-02 13:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077330, 894644, 17507, '<td valign="top">Now, I like cats, and this is a pretty good photo, but boy, I really think this cat is ugly.</td>', 'Now, I like cats, and this is a pretty good photo, but boy, I really think this cat is ugly.', '2010-07-02 13:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077331, 893506, 114225, '<td valign="top">Glad you explained what this was in the title, I had a hard time figuring it out. Are these 50 cal bullets? This is a pretty cool viewpoint, and the B&amp;W shows all the great details in the casings.</td>', 'Glad you explained what this was in the title, I had a hard time figuring it out. Are these 50 cal bullets? This is a pretty cool viewpoint, and the B&W shows all the great details in the casings.', '2010-07-02 13:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077333, 891594, 114225, '<td valign="top">Look at those sad puppy eyes! I think someone doesn''t want to be wearing a hat. :)<br/>I like the graininess to the out of focus areas of this photo, gives it a bit more classic feel.</td>', 'Look at those sad puppy eyes! I think someone doesn''t want to be wearing a hat. :)I like the graininess to the out of focus areas of this photo, gives it a bit more classic feel.', '2010-07-02 13:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077334, 893520, 17507, '<td valign="top">Is "Puffin" the cat''s name, or did you mean to submit a different photo? Cuz this looks like a cat to me.</td>', 'Is "Puffin" the cat''s name, or did you mean to submit a different photo? Cuz this looks like a cat to me.', '2010-07-02 13:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077335, 893566, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. Are they bubbles just before the join into a bigger bubbles.  The colors are interesting, but I''m not a huge can of the reflection (looks like an open door).</td>', 'This is pretty cool. Are they bubbles just before the join into a bigger bubbles.  The colors are interesting, but I''m not a huge can of the reflection (looks like an open door).', '2010-07-02 13:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077337, 894202, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cool photo! Overprocessed.</td>', 'Cool photo! Overprocessed.', '2010-07-02 13:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077338, 894195, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool classic look to this. I could see this being used as art in a log cabin.</td>', 'Very cool classic look to this. I could see this being used as art in a log cabin.', '2010-07-02 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077339, 894178, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nicely worked. I like the inclusion of the moon.</td>', 'Nicely worked. I like the inclusion of the moon.', '2010-07-02 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077340, 891211, 17507, '<td valign="top">Really a provocative and interesting subject, but that background is killing your photo.</td>', 'Really a provocative and interesting subject, but that background is killing your photo.', '2010-07-02 13:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077341, 892049, 17507, '<td valign="top">Yes, a very nice photo, good colors and composition. The bright orange border distracts a great deal from the smooth cool tones of the sky. I probably would have given this at least a 7 without the border treatment, but as it is, it''s a 5 because the border honestly makes me not want to look at this picture.</td>', 'Yes, a very nice photo, good colors and composition. The bright orange border distracts a great deal from the smooth cool tones of the sky. I probably would have given this at least a 7 without the border treatment, but as it is, it''s a 5 because the border honestly makes me not want to look at this picture.', '2010-07-02 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077344, 894195, 17507, '<td valign="top">Uhoh... looks like you''ve got some major sensor dust in the sky.</td>', 'Uhoh... looks like you''ve got some major sensor dust in the sky.', '2010-07-02 13:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077346, 894719, 3735, '<td valign="top">so cool ! 10</td>', 'so cool ! 10', '2010-07-02 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077356, 894517, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. It has a timeless feeling, especially with the sun shining in from the upper right.</td>', 'I like this. It has a timeless feeling, especially with the sun shining in from the upper right.', '2010-07-02 13:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077358, 894056, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very colorful spider! Good focus and lighting in this shot.</td>', 'Very colorful spider! Good focus and lighting in this shot.', '2010-07-02 13:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077359, 892568, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. Many flower shots from above don''t work well, but you framed this well, and used bokeh to your advantage.</td>', 'I like this. Many flower shots from above don''t work well, but you framed this well, and used bokeh to your advantage.', '2010-07-02 13:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077360, 894293, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a nice photo, but I would have liked to see more of the bee in focus.</td>', 'Overall, a nice photo, but I would have liked to see more of the bee in focus.', '2010-07-02 13:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077361, 893201, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute! I love the perspective and the natural framing caused by the taller grass pieces. I would suggest trying to move slightly, so you couldn''t see the house in the background.</td>', 'Cute! I love the perspective and the natural framing caused by the taller grass pieces. I would suggest trying to move slightly, so you couldn''t see the house in the background.', '2010-07-02 13:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077362, 893400, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice overall balance and mood to this photo Good use of duo-tone. I like how the path feels like it''s exiting at the lower left hand corner.</td>', 'Nice overall balance and mood to this photo Good use of duo-tone. I like how the path feels like it''s exiting at the lower left hand corner.', '2010-07-02 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077363, 892301, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details in this shot, especially in mid day sun (seems like it would have been easy to blow out the details in the wings). I love the shadow on the mucky water.</td>', 'Great details in this shot, especially in mid day sun (seems like it would have been easy to blow out the details in the wings). I love the shadow on the mucky water.', '2010-07-02 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077364, 892049, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this shot is contending with itself a bit. By that, I mean there is a definite peaceful feeling, but that chain link fence takes a lot away from the serenity.</td>', 'To me, this shot is contending with itself a bit. By that, I mean there is a definite peaceful feeling, but that chain link fence takes a lot away from the serenity.', '2010-07-02 13:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077365, 893464, 114225, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t figure out what the main subject of the photo was until I read the title. In fact, I didn''t even see the ticket until then. Maybe some vignetting or selective focusing could have helped me out.</td>', 'I couldn''t figure out what the main subject of the photo was until I read the title. In fact, I didn''t even see the ticket until then. Maybe some vignetting or selective focusing could have helped me out.', '2010-07-02 13:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077371, 894233, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the main tree angles through the photo. That ensures that it doesn''t fill too much of the image. I wish the eye of the bird were a bit sharper, maybe using selective sharpening.</td>', 'I like how the main tree angles through the photo. That ensures that it doesn''t fill too much of the image. I wish the eye of the bird were a bit sharper, maybe using selective sharpening.', '2010-07-02 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077375, 892623, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the overall scene, but I''m not much of a fan of the distorted look here. Also, nothing feels particularly sharp, so my eyes aren''t really drawn anywhere in particular.</td>', 'I like the overall scene, but I''m not much of a fan of the distorted look here. Also, nothing feels particularly sharp, so my eyes aren''t really drawn anywhere in particular.', '2010-07-02 13:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077379, 894176, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desaturation here to bring out the flower. I find myself wanting more balance to the photo. The rock face in the bottom half has nothing in the top half to really offset it.</td>', 'Nice use of selective desaturation here to bring out the flower. I find myself wanting more balance to the photo. The rock face in the bottom half has nothing in the top half to really offset it.', '2010-07-02 13:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077380, 894767, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool view an nice colors. Other than looking neat, it doesn''t hold a ton of interest for me.</td>', 'Cool view an nice colors. Other than looking neat, it doesn''t hold a ton of interest for me.', '2010-07-02 13:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077381, 893715, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and duo down of this image. Both work together to give this a timeless feel.</td>', 'I like the composition and duo down of this image. Both work together to give this a timeless feel.', '2010-07-02 13:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077382, 894828, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The water droplets on the falling/floating seeds really adds to the dimensions of the photo.</td>', 'Nice photo. The water droplets on the falling/floating seeds really adds to the dimensions of the photo.', '2010-07-02 13:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077384, 894827, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the deep greens, and the choice of border. Great job showing all the textures in the leaves.</td>', 'I like the deep greens, and the choice of border. Great job showing all the textures in the leaves.', '2010-07-02 13:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077385, 890000, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good attempt. Some things I would suggest for making this better: sharper focus on the bug, maybe less green saturation (seems overpower), and saving so you don''t have bands of colors in the background.</td>', 'Good attempt. Some things I would suggest for making this better: sharper focus on the bug, maybe less green saturation (seems overpower), and saving so you don''t have bands of colors in the background.', '2010-07-02 13:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077394, 894289, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool series. Is this inspired by that recent 1x photo recently shown in the forums? Must be tricky to get the lighting correctly.</td>', 'Cool series. Is this inspired by that recent 1x photo recently shown in the forums? Must be tricky to get the lighting correctly.', '2010-07-02 14:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077396, 893394, 114225, '<td valign="top">OVerall, I like this. I''m sure some won''t like the look of the direct light, but I think it gives a feeling of waiting through the brush with a flashlight. I do wish some of the background elements on the left side would have been cloned out.</td>', 'OVerall, I like this. I''m sure some won''t like the look of the direct light, but I think it gives a feeling of waiting through the brush with a flashlight. I do wish some of the background elements on the left side would have been cloned out.', '2010-07-02 14:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077399, 894516, 30791, '<td valign="top">Wow fantastic timing. And poor frog :(</td>', 'Wow fantastic timing. And poor frog :(', '2010-07-02 14:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077401, 894680, 30791, '<td valign="top">Wow! I want to visit Rio so much more now because of this photo</td>', 'Wow! I want to visit Rio so much more now because of this photo', '2010-07-02 14:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077405, 891520, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a gorgeous location - i just wish we had the ability to see this at a larger size - 800px is not enough.</td>', 'what a gorgeous location - i just wish we had the ability to see this at a larger size - 800px is not enough.', '2010-07-02 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077407, 893464, 67152, '<td valign="top">the color theme is interesting but I am not pulled into the story this is trying to tell</td>', 'the color theme is interesting but I am not pulled into the story this is trying to tell', '2010-07-02 14:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077409, 894339, 67152, '<td valign="top">great shot - nice tribute shot - and well executed!</td>', 'great shot - nice tribute shot - and well executed!', '2010-07-02 14:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077410, 893946, 67152, '<td valign="top">great lighting and intensity - but why do you need the remote?  You aren''t going to change the channel!</td>', 'great lighting and intensity - but why do you need the remote?  You aren''t going to change the channel!', '2010-07-02 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077422, 888138, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''m torn. The perspective is somewhat interesting, but I also feel like there may have been a better perspective available. Of course, without being there, I can''t say for sure.</td>', 'Hmm, I''m torn. The perspective is somewhat interesting, but I also feel like there may have been a better perspective available. Of course, without being there, I can''t say for sure.', '2010-07-02 14:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077424, 894790, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this, but wish it were a wider angle so that I could get more of an immersed feeling.</td>', 'I like this, but wish it were a wider angle so that I could get more of an immersed feeling.', '2010-07-02 14:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077427, 894312, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition, with the vines creating somewhat of a natural border and the wall creating a matting. I''m not sure what to think of the window itself. Is that a reflection, are we seeing into it?</td>', 'I like the overall composition, with the vines creating somewhat of a natural border and the wall creating a matting. I''m not sure what to think of the window itself. Is that a reflection, are we seeing into it?', '2010-07-02 14:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077429, 893197, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this, all except the splotch of light on the church itself.</td>', 'I like the lighting in this, all except the splotch of light on the church itself.', '2010-07-02 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077432, 894202, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good shot with a very dramatic sky. The highway leads my eye from front/center off the the right, kind of taking me away from the detail on the left.</td>', 'Good shot with a very dramatic sky. The highway leads my eye from front/center off the the right, kind of taking me away from the detail on the left.', '2010-07-02 14:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077448, 894630, 114225, '<td valign="top">I do like the silhouettes, but also wish they were darker so we couldn''t se the houses in the background.</td>', 'I do like the silhouettes, but also wish they were darker so we couldn''t se the houses in the background.', '2010-07-02 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077449, 893680, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo. Her eyes are memorizing. Good colors and softness to the skin.</td>', 'Very pretty photo. Her eyes are memorizing. Good colors and softness to the skin.', '2010-07-02 14:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077457, 894392, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely scene - so sad about the oil gushing to ruin the lives of so many</td>', 'lovely scene - so sad about the oil gushing to ruin the lives of so many', '2010-07-02 14:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077460, 894775, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this, and the post processing is kinda cool. I don''t like the power lines running through it.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this, and the post processing is kinda cool. I don''t like the power lines running through it.', '2010-07-02 14:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077463, 894762, 67152, '<td valign="top">what an amazing mansion - the sky frames it so nicely - i would just be a bit careful with the sharpening - you can see a sharp white halo around the building</td>', 'what an amazing mansion - the sky frames it so nicely - i would just be a bit careful with the sharpening - you can see a sharp white halo around the building', '2010-07-02 14:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077466, 893800, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool concept - i am not crazy about the shadow behind the head</td>', 'cool concept - i am not crazy about the shadow behind the head', '2010-07-02 14:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077467, 894808, 114225, '<td valign="top">Before I read the title, I thought "wow, that''s some amazing power!" Great feeling to this photo, I just wish the shadows were a bit lighter so we could see the face better.</td>', 'Before I read the title, I thought "wow, that''s some amazing power!" Great feeling to this photo, I just wish the shadows were a bit lighter so we could see the face better.', '2010-07-02 15:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077469, 894013, 67152, '<td valign="top">interesting looking bird - i wonder if it is a bit oversharpened</td>', 'interesting looking bird - i wonder if it is a bit oversharpened', '2010-07-02 15:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077470, 894556, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a cute dog portrait. Either she is saying "do I have to come in" or "did I do something wrong". Great clarity, depth of field, and composition.</td>', 'This is a cute dog portrait. Either she is saying "do I have to come in" or "did I do something wrong". Great clarity, depth of field, and composition.', '2010-07-02 15:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077471, 894777, 67152, '<td valign="top">the DOF almost makes the feathers look like an explosion has gone off - i like</td>', 'the DOF almost makes the feathers look like an explosion has gone off - i like', '2010-07-02 15:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077473, 894556, 67152, '<td valign="top">that is one intense face - lovely</td>', 'that is one intense face - lovely', '2010-07-02 15:01:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6077474, 893976, 67152, '<td valign="top">great capture</td>', 'great capture', '2010-07-02 15:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077475, 894571, 114225, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the architecture in this, but the completely blown out sky is unappealing to me.</td>', 'I appreciate the architecture in this, but the completely blown out sky is unappealing to me.', '2010-07-02 15:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077476, 894162, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good overall balance to this photo. I would have probably chosen to clone out the power lines in the sky, but they aren''t too bad.</td>', 'Good overall balance to this photo. I would have probably chosen to clone out the power lines in the sky, but they aren''t too bad.', '2010-07-02 15:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077478, 894627, 67152, '<td valign="top">what an amazing landscape and so beautifully and masterfully captured</td>', 'what an amazing landscape and so beautifully and masterfully captured', '2010-07-02 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077479, 893230, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great classic photo of classic architecture. Not sure if I like or dislike the halo effect, as it kind of works to separate the building from the sky.</td>', 'Great classic photo of classic architecture. Not sure if I like or dislike the halo effect, as it kind of works to separate the building from the sky.', '2010-07-02 15:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077482, 892844, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise. Great job capturing some of the details in the foreground with such a strong backlight.</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise. Great job capturing some of the details in the foreground with such a strong backlight.', '2010-07-02 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077485, 892356, 67152, '<td valign="top">the layers of mountains and hills is nice - i just wonder if there is too much sky in the shot to really emphasize them enough</td>', 'the layers of mountains and hills is nice - i just wonder if there is too much sky in the shot to really emphasize them enough', '2010-07-02 15:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077487, 894405, 67152, '<td valign="top">now that is something I haven''t seen before!  great real life capture</td>', 'now that is something I haven''t seen before!  great real life capture', '2010-07-02 15:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077488, 891654, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice work - these are always impressive to see done well</td>', 'nice work - these are always impressive to see done well', '2010-07-02 15:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077498, 890379, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent placement of the umbrella to draw interest to this scene</td>', 'excellent placement of the umbrella to draw interest to this scene', '2010-07-02 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077523, 893283, 67152, '<td valign="top">very cool shot - love the use of b/w to further hide this very unusual critter</td>', 'very cool shot - love the use of b/w to further hide this very unusual critter', '2010-07-02 15:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077563, 893775, 68546, '<td valign="top">The pose is good here and you have a good model but the lighting and aperture have given you a completely flat image. There are a couple of things that woul have drastically improved this, firstly shooting on a wider aperture to throw everything but the model out of focus would have made the image stand out more. Secondly, and more importantly is the lighting, anything to give some kind of modelling to the face and body would have helped. Unfortunately the model blends into the background and there is no depth to this shot. Hope that''s helpful, if not please feel free to PM me</td>', 'The pose is good here and you have a good model but the lighting and aperture have given you a completely flat image. There are a couple of things that woul have drastically improved this, firstly shooting on a wider aperture to throw everything but the model out of focus would have made the image stand out more. Secondly, and more importantly is the lighting, anything to give some kind of modelling to the face and body would have helped. Unfortunately the model blends into the background and there is no depth to this shot. Hope that''s helpful, if not please feel free to PM me', '2010-07-02 16:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077565, 893803, 68546, '<td valign="top">beautiful, such lovely skin tones and lighting. I don''t mind the softening you''ve added either. Lovely portrait</td>', 'beautiful, such lovely skin tones and lighting. I don''t mind the softening you''ve added either. Lovely portrait', '2010-07-02 16:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077568, 890306, 83845, '<td valign="top">10. I know firsthand how incredibly hard this must have been.  I''m very curious the process behind this.  Did you have a mouse on your head? LOL.</td>', '10. I know firsthand how incredibly hard this must have been.  I''m very curious the process behind this.  Did you have a mouse on your head? LOL.', '2010-07-02 16:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077570, 894491, 68546, '<td valign="top">The Hair is fantastic here, I''m not so keen on the bleaching and softening of the skin and top to the level you''ve done here, but the hair looks great</td>', 'The Hair is fantastic here, I''m not so keen on the bleaching and softening of the skin and top to the level you''ve done here, but the hair looks great', '2010-07-02 16:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077572, 894569, 68546, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and processing on this shot, but the models pose looks awkward to me. I think its the fact she''s looking so far out of shot with her chin quite high. I''m not saying she should be looking at the camera, it just feels awkward to me how she is posed?</td>', 'Great lighting and processing on this shot, but the models pose looks awkward to me. I think its the fact she''s looking so far out of shot with her chin quite high. I''m not saying she should be looking at the camera, it just feels awkward to me how she is posed?', '2010-07-02 16:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077574, 894782, 68546, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, crop, expression, but I''m not convinced about the yellow colour cast?</td>', 'Lovely lighting, crop, expression, but I''m not convinced about the yellow colour cast?', '2010-07-02 16:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077593, 894450, 17507, '<td valign="top">Overcast flat lighting, soft focus, and distracting bokeh diminish what could otherwise be an appealing wildlife shot.</td>', 'Overcast flat lighting, soft focus, and distracting bokeh diminish what could otherwise be an appealing wildlife shot.', '2010-07-02 17:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077595, 888095, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and gets your attention. Pitty about hot light on top of umbrella but that''s the time of day you are in I suppose.</td>', 'Lovely shot and gets your attention. Pitty about hot light on top of umbrella but that''s the time of day you are in I suppose.', '2010-07-02 17:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077604, 893604, 94241, '<td valign="top">The backwards bend of her arm distracts me from the rest of her beauty.</td>', 'The backwards bend of her arm distracts me from the rest of her beauty.', '2010-07-02 17:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077613, 890200, 86218, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and certainly has one looking and thinking. Got a floating feeling about it - surreal. nice</td>', 'Interesting perspective and certainly has one looking and thinking. Got a floating feeling about it - surreal. nice', '2010-07-02 17:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077622, 894674, 86218, '<td valign="top">Man I whish I could have been there. Lucky fish to have been here. Nice take on a very difficult subject</td>', 'Man I whish I could have been there. Lucky fish to have been here. Nice take on a very difficult subject', '2010-07-02 17:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6077626, 891727, 54833, '<td valign="top">I almost feel like I''m gonna fall over, but overall I love this shot! The tone and contrast are great with just the right amount of sharpness.</td>', 'I almost feel like I''m gonna fall over, but overall I love this shot! The tone and contrast are great with just the right amount of sharpness.', '2010-07-02 17:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
