(6078270, 890529, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like this stylized processing (B&amp;W/high key).  I think the composition works well in placing the girl in a third of the frame but including the entire road and puddle showing the expanse of the puddle.  I like the inclusion of the hand/arm of the father that conveys the watchful eye of the parent but not having him in the frame which may have taken away from the child.  I like the capture of the concentration of the girl on her next step.  Wonderful story telling image.  Deserves a 10.</td>', 'I like this stylized processing (B&W/high key).  I think the composition works well in placing the girl in a third of the frame but including the entire road and puddle showing the expanse of the puddle.  I like the inclusion of the hand/arm of the father that conveys the watchful eye of the parent but not having him in the frame which may have taken away from the child.  I like the capture of the concentration of the girl on her next step.  Wonderful story telling image.  Deserves a 10.', '2010-07-03 03:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6078274, 893667, 103032, '<td valign="top">Love Cannon Beach.  Very interesting sunset shot with the star streaks.  The sunset itself is nicely composed between the two outcroppings and reflection in the water and sand.  The star streaks adds another dimension to the image.  Must tell in your notes how you achieved this.  Best of luck in the voting.</td>', 'Love Cannon Beach.  Very interesting sunset shot with the star streaks.  The sunset itself is nicely composed between the two outcroppings and reflection in the water and sand.  The star streaks adds another dimension to the image.  Must tell in your notes how you achieved this.  Best of luck in the voting.', '2010-07-03 03:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
