(6078443, 894770, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m starting to recognize this young lady. This is going to be the entry from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=39057" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Kenskid</a>. The can of oil does not quite fit with the rest of the portrait, and I think that incongruity is part of what I like about it.</td>', 'I''m starting to recognize this young lady. This is going to be the entry from  Kenskid. The can of oil does not quite fit with the rest of the portrait, and I think that incongruity is part of what I like about it.', '2010-07-03 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
