(6078632, 894211, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog leave forest, spot many large caves with bright fire inside. Grog smell something good. Can person with magic picture box tell Grog where find legendary "Ray''s Pizza"? Original one, to please Grog.</td>', 'Grog leave forest, spot many large caves with bright fire inside. Grog smell something good. Can person with magic picture box tell Grog where find legendary "Ray''s Pizza"? Original one, to please Grog.', '2010-07-03 14:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
