(6078656, 894808, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bah, Grog not afraid of jungle cat! Grog snarls back!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=887971" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_887971.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_887971.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_887971.jpg"/></a> <br/>Worry not, because Grog is great lover of animals. Grog love this one with barbecue sauce.</td>', 'Bah, Grog not afraid of jungle cat! Grog snarls back! Worry not, because Grog is great lover of animals. Grog love this one with barbecue sauce.', '2010-07-03 15:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
