(6078711, 894598, 86218, '<td valign="top">Im very curious to see how this one is going to do. This is one of those love/dislike type shots and the DPC type voting bunch is a curious breed. Perfect processing from my me. Love the colours in the foreground but the top halve for me does not carry the scene so well despite the strong mood this type of light should install in a pic like this. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Im very curious to see how this one is going to do. This is one of those love/dislike type shots and the DPC type voting bunch is a curious breed. Perfect processing from my me. Love the colours in the foreground but the top halve for me does not carry the scene so well despite the strong mood this type of light should install in a pic like this. Hope it does well for you.', '2010-07-03 16:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6078720, 894607, 86218, '<td valign="top">Dont know what it is but really a captivating shot....you have to stare and wonder what this person is thinking. Smile almost a Mona lisa type. Love it. 8</td>', 'Dont know what it is but really a captivating shot....you have to stare and wonder what this person is thinking. Smile almost a Mona lisa type. Love it. 8', '2010-07-03 16:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
