(6079478, 894569, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is just dynamic, from the colors, to the hot pose, to the centered composition, to the cool yellow car, to the outfit - really good stuff.</td>', 'This is just dynamic, from the colors, to the hot pose, to the centered composition, to the cool yellow car, to the outfit - really good stuff.', '2010-07-04 08:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
