(6079485, 894798, 86799, '<td valign="top">I know you wanted to keep the tops of the ears, but I don''t think they are essential.  That bit of background is distracting and would be better gone, IMO.  Great detail.</td>', 'I know you wanted to keep the tops of the ears, but I don''t think they are essential.  That bit of background is distracting and would be better gone, IMO.  Great detail.', '2010-07-04 08:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
