(6079927, 894586, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not totally sure what it is with this entry, maybe a combination of factors, but I think this is the kind of shot that encourages many to just hit the 4 or 5 key and press on. I''ll try and identify some of what may not be working and hope it''s helpful for you.<br/> <br/>-Looks like a strong overhead sun. Midday sun is usually the least flattering light.<br/>-There may be some oversharpening going on, the detail in the foliage seems pixelated to me.<br/>-Using less compression may have also helped. The 163k file size is just over half the allowed file size and this is a very detailed scene. You may have lost some clarity due to compression and I can see some blocky compression artifacts in the water spray in the center.<br/>-The water from the fountain seems grayish in color and not terribly dramatic looking or interesting. I wonder if you may have been trying to pull in some detail using highlight recovery.</td>', 'Not totally sure what it is with this entry, maybe a combination of factors, but I think this is the kind of shot that encourages many to just hit the 4 or 5 key and press on. I''ll try and identify some of what may not be working and hope it''s helpful for you. -Looks like a strong overhead sun. Midday sun is usually the least flattering light.-There may be some oversharpening going on, the detail in the foliage seems pixelated to me.-Using less compression may have also helped. The 163k file size is just over half the allowed file size and this is a very detailed scene. You may have lost some clarity due to compression and I can see some blocky compression artifacts in the water spray in the center.-The water from the fountain seems grayish in color and not terribly dramatic looking or interesting. I wonder if you may have been trying to pull in some detail using highlight recovery.', '2010-07-04 18:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079928, 894569, 61552, '<td valign="top">Then confuse us with Mt. St. Helens in the background....</td>', 'Then confuse us with Mt. St. Helens in the background....', '2010-07-04 18:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
