(6081768, 893792, 15511, '<td valign="top">Your composition is well proportioned. It has a slightly blue tint to it. Generally, plant greens have more yellow than green in their coloring. Additionally, this would add more brown to the cat...</td>', 'Your composition is well proportioned. It has a slightly blue tint to it. Generally, plant greens have more yellow than green in their coloring. Additionally, this would add more brown to the cat...', '2010-07-06 01:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
