(6081853, 894798, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, gorgeous kitty, and an amazing moment.  I''m a little unsure that I like the post processing though.<br/> <br/>A few ideas:  Were it me, I''d have cranked the warmth up a little and the saturation up a lot.  I''d have played with brightness to darken the midtones but leave the highlights bright, to draw more attention to those areas.  And since this is advanced editing, I''d probably recolor the eyes to bring more warmth and light to them.  Finally, the vignette is pretty harsh, darkening the corners including her ears.  If you''d masked out the ears so they were unaffected by the vignette I think it would have added dimension.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, gorgeous kitty, and an amazing moment.  I''m a little unsure that I like the post processing though. A few ideas:  Were it me, I''d have cranked the warmth up a little and the saturation up a lot.  I''d have played with brightness to darken the midtones but leave the highlights bright, to draw more attention to those areas.  And since this is advanced editing, I''d probably recolor the eyes to bring more warmth and light to them.  Finally, the vignette is pretty harsh, darkening the corners including her ears.  If you''d masked out the ears so they were unaffected by the vignette I think it would have added dimension.', '2010-07-06 03:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081873, 894587, 94241, '<td valign="top">I know there''s lore that says to get a tree or branch in the shot to help frame the subject, I''m not a fan of the technique.  To me it just makes a barrier between the viewer and the subject.  I think this image is a lot stronger if cropped down to be just the mountain and its reflection.  With the little whiff of clouds boiling over it especially; the clouds just get lost in the frame otherwise.</td>', 'I know there''s lore that says to get a tree or branch in the shot to help frame the subject, I''m not a fan of the technique.  To me it just makes a barrier between the viewer and the subject.  I think this image is a lot stronger if cropped down to be just the mountain and its reflection.  With the little whiff of clouds boiling over it especially; the clouds just get lost in the frame otherwise.', '2010-07-06 03:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081875, 893158, 94241, '<td valign="top">The trees gets lost in the picture, shadows among shadows.  Honestly not an image I would have made black and white.  In color the trees might have stood out more.  But black and white is hard, you have only varying shades of grey to define and separate shapes.  This picture has a lot of fine, detailed, textural stuff, without a lot to separate any one piece from another.</td>', 'The trees gets lost in the picture, shadows among shadows.  Honestly not an image I would have made black and white.  In color the trees might have stood out more.  But black and white is hard, you have only varying shades of grey to define and separate shapes.  This picture has a lot of fine, detailed, textural stuff, without a lot to separate any one piece from another.', '2010-07-06 03:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081877, 888077, 94241, '<td valign="top">I feel the tones in this are crunched up.  I think you were going for a delicate touch, but I feel it could use a bit more brightness to the bright parts.</td>', 'I feel the tones in this are crunched up.  I think you were going for a delicate touch, but I feel it could use a bit more brightness to the bright parts.', '2010-07-06 03:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081878, 893881, 94241, '<td valign="top">Shadow of his(her?) horn is amazing.  If I could offer one tip, I think this would be a stronger image if you had completely blacked out the grass behind the face.<br/> <br/>Honestly I''m not a fan of pointillism, but kudos to showing a style we don''t see much.</td>', 'Shadow of his(her?) horn is amazing.  If I could offer one tip, I think this would be a stronger image if you had completely blacked out the grass behind the face. Honestly I''m not a fan of pointillism, but kudos to showing a style we don''t see much.', '2010-07-06 03:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
