(6082888, 893388, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/>I really like this. I know I''m supposed to offer comment that isn''t empty, but this is a photo I wish I could say I''d created. Kudos</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth... I really like this. I know I''m supposed to offer comment that isn''t empty, but this is a photo I wish I could say I''d created. Kudos', '2010-07-07 00:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082892, 894550, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/>Just doing a quick scroll through the 300+ images in this submission. This one stopped the click-through for me and had me stop to stare. I love the quality of the light you''ve captured and the effectiveness of the square aspect ratio!</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth... Just doing a quick scroll through the 300+ images in this submission. This one stopped the click-through for me and had me stop to stare. I love the quality of the light you''ve captured and the effectiveness of the square aspect ratio!', '2010-07-07 00:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082911, 894587, 37845, '<td valign="top">Incredible reflection. Not sure if the cut-off trees help the photo or not, but I do like that you included some foreground elements.</td>', 'Incredible reflection. Not sure if the cut-off trees help the photo or not, but I do like that you included some foreground elements.', '2010-07-07 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
