(6082918, 892748, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/>This is such a peaceful image. The gentle arching line of the water at the shore and the beautifully balanced placement of the sun off-center (but not quite at the 1/3 point) is really effective. I want to be there!</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth... This is such a peaceful image. The gentle arching line of the water at the shore and the beautifully balanced placement of the sun off-center (but not quite at the 1/3 point) is really effective. I want to be there!', '2010-07-07 00:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082920, 894231, 37845, '<td valign="top">Such an incredible scene. I like the lower clouds, and the moutain the the b/g.</td>', 'Such an incredible scene. I like the lower clouds, and the moutain the the b/g.', '2010-07-07 00:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082922, 894544, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/>Wow. What a spectacular moment you''ve captured. This is my favorite so far in this challenge. The light is amazing!</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth... Wow. What a spectacular moment you''ve captured. This is my favorite so far in this challenge. The light is amazing!', '2010-07-07 00:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082926, 894826, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/> I really like the way the white petals in the upper left frame the central focus on the yellow and the bee. The only distraction for me is the lower right corner.</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...  I really like the way the white petals in the upper left frame the central focus on the yellow and the bee. The only distraction for me is the lower right corner.', '2010-07-07 00:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082929, 893964, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/>Nice lines and effective tonal range. I really like the composition and crop.</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth... Nice lines and effective tonal range. I really like the composition and crop.', '2010-07-07 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082933, 894022, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/>So simple. The placement of the subjects at the extreme lower border is surprisingly effective. Very nice idea and execution!</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth... So simple. The placement of the subjects at the extreme lower border is surprisingly effective. Very nice idea and execution!', '2010-07-07 00:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082936, 894410, 115814, '<td valign="top">Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth...<br/> <br/>What an unusual perspective. This is a truly original take on a oft-seen cliche. You''ve managed to take something common (as a subject and as a photographic treatment) and make it new. I''m just clicking through the images in this challenge, but this is tops so far. Can''t imagine what would top it for me. Kudos!!!</td>', 'Comment from an amateur, non-voting, non-member. Take it for what it''s worth... What an unusual perspective. This is a truly original take on a oft-seen cliche. You''ve managed to take something common (as a subject and as a photographic treatment) and make it new. I''m just clicking through the images in this challenge, but this is tops so far. Can''t imagine what would top it for me. Kudos!!!', '2010-07-07 00:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6082939, 894022, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalist photo.</td>', 'Nice minimalist photo.', '2010-07-07 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
