(6083822, 894002, 63218, '<td valign="top">looked at this for a long time, while I ate my breakfast, &amp; it grew on me. it is the beautiful, subtle variation in shadows that makes this shot.  I''m wondering if you tried w/no noise, &amp; what that looked like.</td>', 'looked at this for a long time, while I ate my breakfast, & it grew on me. it is the beautiful, subtle variation in shadows that makes this shot.  I''m wondering if you tried w/no noise, & what that looked like.', '2010-07-07 11:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6083823, 890786, 63218, '<td valign="top">"D this is just begging to be printed, framed in gold, &amp; placed where you can show it off. The BG ''makes'' this shot. Nice work!</td>', '"D this is just begging to be printed, framed in gold, & placed where you can show it off. The BG ''makes'' this shot. Nice work!', '2010-07-07 11:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6083831, 891388, 63218, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite subjects, so of course it went straight to my heart. The subtle ''cloudy day'' color shows off the droplets very well.  Please accept my humble admiration &amp; the Gilded Lily for (IMO) excellent flower photography.</td>', 'One of my favorite subjects, so of course it went straight to my heart. The subtle ''cloudy day'' color shows off the droplets very well.  Please accept my humble admiration & the Gilded Lily for (IMO) excellent flower photography.', '2010-07-07 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6083919, 893784, 62989, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed - but as a quibble can I point out that I can see his feet shod with gauze and his helmet of gold, but I can''t see his breast at all.</td>', 'Very nice indeed - but as a quibble can I point out that I can see his feet shod with gauze and his helmet of gold, but I can''t see his breast at all.', '2010-07-07 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
