(6084081, 894825, 22392, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Too bad about the dark color of the sea, but that can´t be helped. Northsea I guess? Would have looked even better in front of the turqoise of the meditarian but still lovely picture.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Too bad about the dark color of the sea, but that can´t be helped. Northsea I guess? Would have looked even better in front of the turqoise of the meditarian but still lovely picture.', '2010-07-07 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
