(6084973, 893712, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh how I love this beautiful photo.  I love taking pictures when its barely raining too.  There''s nothing like it for making colors vibrant and pretty.  Congratulations on honorable mention.</td>', 'Oh how I love this beautiful photo.  I love taking pictures when its barely raining too.  There''s nothing like it for making colors vibrant and pretty.  Congratulations on honorable mention.', '2010-07-08 02:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
