(6084978, 890635, 24454, '<td valign="top">Was that taken at Weehawken?  I remember being at Weehawken at about 1:00 in the morning taking a shot like this, and it was so beautiful I could hardly stand it.  You captured it so well!  CONGRATULATIONS on an honorable mention!</td>', 'Was that taken at Weehawken?  I remember being at Weehawken at about 1:00 in the morning taking a shot like this, and it was so beautiful I could hardly stand it.  You captured it so well!  CONGRATULATIONS on an honorable mention!', '2010-07-08 02:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
