(6085143, 893562, 57229, '<td valign="top">Why on earth do your pictures keep cimoing up last?<br/> There''s a conspiracy out there and someone''s got your number.<br/>Well, there are useful enough things said in some of the comments, and at least it doesn''t stop you.<br/>It''s a lovely bit of nature.</td>', 'Why on earth do your pictures keep cimoing up last? There''s a conspiracy out there and someone''s got your number.Well, there are useful enough things said in some of the comments, and at least it doesn''t stop you.It''s a lovely bit of nature.', '2010-07-08 07:32:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6085145, 894586, 57229, '<td valign="top">The fountain, certainly, is very well captured. The rest is as others have pointed out, although the omitted implication there is that you made some sort of mistake photographing the real world how it is. You didn''t. It''s good. I intend to browse all future results from the bottom up to find the quality.</td>', 'The fountain, certainly, is very well captured. The rest is as others have pointed out, although the omitted implication there is that you made some sort of mistake photographing the real world how it is. You didn''t. It''s good. I intend to browse all future results from the bottom up to find the quality.', '2010-07-08 07:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
