(6085186, 894586, 117831, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Ouch. I hate when I do that. There''s a good reason voting is anonymous, I suppose. At least I left you some detailed feedback with my 4. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Even if voting weren''t anonymous, if everyone who gave me a 4 or below gave me feedback like that I would NEVER complain about a LOW score! That is the kind of feedback one can grow from, learn from, and expand from! Its very much appreciated!</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Ouch. I hate when I do that. There''s a good reason voting is anonymous, I suppose. At least I left you some detailed feedback with my 4.   Even if voting weren''t anonymous, if everyone who gave me a 4 or below gave me feedback like that I would NEVER complain about a LOW score! That is the kind of feedback one can grow from, learn from, and expand from! Its very much appreciated!', '2010-07-08 08:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
