(6085325, 894517, 35545, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I really like the silhouette of the dog and kids.<br/> <br/>As to the voters, your guess is as good as mine.  I wonder if more color in the sky would have helped -- one of those Kodachrome sunsets that we get in December and January?<br/> <br/>P.S.  You were lucky to get some sun at all -- seems like the marine layer has been parked over us for as long as I can remember.  8)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great capture.  I really like the silhouette of the dog and kids. As to the voters, your guess is as good as mine.  I wonder if more color in the sky would have helped -- one of those Kodachrome sunsets that we get in December and January? P.S.  You were lucky to get some sun at all -- seems like the marine layer has been parked over us for as long as I can remember.  8) ', '2010-07-08 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 0),
