(6086340, 890635, 89230, '<td valign="top">Hong Kong is a very over photographed city, especially from this angle. However, I think this photo is, by far, the best photo that I have ever seen of the city. You have done a FANTASTIC job in capturing it. You have been robbed on only a 6.95, because it should be far higher than that. Great, great job!</td>', 'Hong Kong is a very over photographed city, especially from this angle. However, I think this photo is, by far, the best photo that I have ever seen of the city. You have done a FANTASTIC job in capturing it. You have been robbed on only a 6.95, because it should be far higher than that. Great, great job!', '2010-07-09 10:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
