(6086902, 894312, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is astonishing.  Just when I think I understand what I am looking at, I realize it is far more... And there is that wierd thing at the lower left where a young woman appears to be diapering a rather large teddy bear.  Where do all the faces come from? Is this just a framed mirror set into a wall?  Why does no one discuss this?  Why are there so many lukewarm votes?  Aargh, there is no one left but me to go running throught the streets crying, Mira, Mira. Could it be because it is in Switzerland?  The wrong part of Switzerland for crying Mira Mira.<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-07-09 21:22:15.</i></td>', 'This is astonishing.  Just when I think I understand what I am looking at, I realize it is far more... And there is that wierd thing at the lower left where a young woman appears to be diapering a rather large teddy bear.  Where do all the faces come from? Is this just a framed mirror set into a wall?  Why does no one discuss this?  Why are there so many lukewarm votes?  Aargh, there is no one left but me to go running throught the streets crying, Mira, Mira. Could it be because it is in Switzerland?  The wrong part of Switzerland for crying Mira Mira. ', '2010-07-09 22:18:19.000000', '2010-07-09 22:22:15.000000', 0),
